  "versionNotes": [
    {
      "edition": "ASP.NET Core 11 / .NET 11 GA checked 2026-11-14",
      "items": [
        "ASP.NET Core 11 generates OpenAPI 3.2 by default; .NET 10 generated 3.1 by default. Explicitly select 3.1 when downstream tooling cannot consume 3.2.",
        "ASP.NET Core 11 upgrades Microsoft.OpenApi to 3.x, which changes transformer-facing model APIs; custom transformers written against 2.x may need source changes.",
        "ASP.NET Core 11 OpenAPI adds binary file response descriptions, HTTP QUERY operation descriptions for OpenAPI 3.2, and SSE itemSchema descriptions. Do not claim these are available in an OpenAPI 3.1 document.",
        "API versioning remains a separate Asp.Versioning package family rather than a built-in ASP.NET Core feature. The old Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Versioning package family is deprecated; keep exact third-party package APIs labeled as such.",
        "ASP.NET Core 11 UseExceptionHandler preserves BadHttpRequestException.StatusCode by default in Problem Details responses. Applications that depended on conversion to 500 should review their custom exception handling."
      ],
